===Etymology===
[[File:Pirate Flag.svg|thumb|A traditional depiction of a Jolly Roger]]

Possibly from {{m|en|jolly}} + {{m|en|Roger||dialectal nickname for the Devil}}.<ref>{{R:Oxford Dictionaries Online}}</ref>

